    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Present tense of verbs ending in -ω",
     "texto": [
      "Many verbs in the present end in **-ω**: **δουλεύω** (I work), **διαβάζω** (I read/study), **γράφω** (I write). To talk about «you», the ending is usually **-εις**: **δουλεύεις, διαβάζεις, γράφεις**.",
      "**Κάθε μέρα** means every day. **Το πρωί** is in the morning and **το βράδυ** at night."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
